  "summary": "MacSync is a multi-stage macOS stealer and RAT delivered via malvertising campaigns using fake AI-themed install guides. The malware steals a wide range of data including browser credentials, keychain secrets, and cryptocurrency wallets, and can trojanize existing wallet applications to phish for recovery phrases. It establishes persistence with a native Mach-O RAT that communicates over a raw-IP TLS channel.",
